://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-09T16:29:03Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T18:37:40Z","closed_at":"2026-09-28T18:37:40Z","assignee":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in official builds:\n\n- `4.7.1.stable.mono.official.a13da4feb`\n- `4.7.dev5.mono.official.a8643700c`\n- `4.6.2.stable.mono.official.71f334935`\n\nGodot 4.2.2 did not complete the MRP within the bounded timeout and is below the tested project's API baseline, so it is not treated as a negative result.\n\n### System information\n\nMicrosoft Windows 11 Home 10.0.26200 (build 26200) - Godot 4.7.1 stable Mono - D3D12 12_0 (Forward+) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Ti, driver 32.0.15.9579 - AMD Ryzen 9 5950X (32 threads) - SteamVR/OpenXR 2.16.7 - OpenXR 1.0.54\n\n### Issue description\n\nA standalone GDScript project initializes OpenXR through SteamVR, enables XR rendering for ten frames, disables XR on the viewport, calls `XRInterface.uninitialize()`, confirms `interface_initialized=false`, and exits with code 0.\n\nAt engine shutdown, Godot reports:\n\n```text\nERROR: Attempt to disconnect a nonexistent connection from '<OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension#...>'. Signal: 'spatial_discovery_recommended', callable: 'OpenXRSpatialMarkerTrackingCapability::_on_spatial_discovery_recommended'.\n```\n\nThis reproduces when the OpenXR action map contains zero interaction profiles and the project does not use spatial entities. It also reproduces in a second cell containing one simple-controller profile.\n\nExpected behavior: shutdown after explicit OpenXR teardown should not attempt to disconnect a signal connection that does not exist.\n\nThis is distinct from #113751, which concerned verbose orphan `StringName` diagnostics, and from #119042, where RID leaks followed a failed OpenXR session initialization. Here OpenXR initializes successfully and the application teardown completes before the diagnostic.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start SteamVR and select SteamVR as the active OpenXR runtime.\n2. Download the MRP from `https://gist.github.com/zedarvates/bf1a9872453911f486473fc6ad85f904` and follow its README.\n3. Run `run-probe.ps1` with the official Godot 4.7.1 Mono console executable and `-ExpectedOutcome reproduce`.\n4. Observe that both cells report `initialized=True`, `teardown=True`, `timed_out=False`, and process exit 0.\n5. Observe the nonexistent `spatial_discovery_recommended` signal disconnection after teardown in both full logs.\n6. Run with `-ExpectedOutcome clean`; the runner exits with code 1 because the shutdown diagnostic remains.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://gist.github.com/zedarvates/bf1a9872453911f486473fc6ad85f904\n\nThe linked secret gist contains a base64-encoded ZIP with both GDScript projects, the bounded runner, instructions, and the two reference logs from Godot 4.7.1. The ZIP excludes `.godot`, C# code, addons, autoloads, and application assets.\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122238/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122238/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}